            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A lid? (झाकण, jhākaṇ.) A jar? (बरणी, barṇī.) A spiced lentil curry? (आमटी, āmṭī.) A sprouted-bean curry? (उसळ, usaḷ.) A pickle? (लोणचे, loṇce.) Almonds? (बदाम, badām.) Raisins? (मनुका, manukā.) Jaggery? (गूळ, gūḷ.) A dhoti? (धोतर, dhotar.) A kurta? (कुर्ता, kurtā.) A government office? (कचेरी, kacerī.) A bus station? (बसस्थानक, basasthānak.) A blanket? (पांघरूण, pāṅgharūṇ.) A veranda? (ओसरी, osrī.) A broom? (झाडू, jhāḍū.)"
            }
